w, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request’s order; a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KeychainKeyStore"},{"type":"text","text":" requiring user presence asks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the holder once for them all. On a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WalletError"},{"type":"text","text":" — the prompt"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cancelled, say — nothing is returned, and the request can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"answered again."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(answers:)","title":"respond(answers:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/batchSize":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/batchsize","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"batchSize"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"batchSize","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","abstract":[{"text":"How many copies of each credential to request when an issuer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"offers batches, each bound to its own key, so each presentation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can use one no Verifier has seen. 0 means the SDK’s default (5);","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"it’s capped at the issuer’s batch size.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KeychainKeyStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore","abstract":[{"text":"The wallet’s keys, in the Secure Enclave and the Keychain: P-256 keys","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whose private halves never leave the Security framework. Each key’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"ID is its Keychain application tag (after "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Options.tagPrefix"},{"text":"), and","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"its label names its purpose. Holder keys also agree keys (ECDH), for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"deviceMac in person: a P-256 key in the Secure Enclave or the Keychain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can, with nothing asked of it at creation.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KeychainKeyStore","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore","title":"KeychainKeyStore","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"title":"Swift.SendableMetatype","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s16SendableMetatypeP"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/holderUserPresence":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/holderuserpresence","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"holderUserPresence"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"holderUserPresence","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/holderUserPresence","abstract":[{"text":"Require user presence (Face ID, Touch ID or the passcode) for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every signature with a holder key: to present a credential,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and to sign the Credential Request’s jwt proofs, so receiving","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and refreshing credentials ask too — once per copy","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/batchSize","isActive":true},{"text":"), or once per Credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Request when its jwt proof carries a key attestation, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"again if the issuer refuses the nonce — and a refresh can’t","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"run without the holder. The Secure Enclave","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enforces it. Off, the app asks for it itself (with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LAContext.evaluatePolicy"},{"text":") before every presentation — in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the app, from a link, through a document provider extension,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and in person — a check the app’s own code keeps, not the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"key. For Face ID, the app’s Info.plist must have an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSFaceIDUsageDescription"},{"text":"; without one, iOS asks for the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"passcode instead. A presentation answering several documents","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"at once (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/respond(answers:)","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/MdocPresentation\/respond(answers:)","isActive":true},{"text":") asks once: its holder","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"keys share one authentication context for that call only.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/persistent":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/persistent","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"persistent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"persistent","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/KeychainKeyStore\/Options-swift.struct\/persistent","abstract":[{"text":"Keep keys in the Keychain, across launches. Off, they live","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only as long as this store (for tests: the Keychain needs a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"signed host app on iOS).","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/ProximityPresentation/respond(answers:)":{"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"respond","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"answers","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"MdocPresentation","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Answer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet16MdocPresentationC6AnswerV"},{"text":"]) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Responded","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12OID4VCWallet21ProximityPresentationC9RespondedV"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/proximitypresentation\/respond(answers:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Presents several of the request’s documents in one response, each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of "},{"code":"answers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as "},{"code":"respond(document:credentialID:elements:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" presents"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one, and sends it, which ends the session. A document left out"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"isn’t in the response: the reader may ask for more than the holder"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"shares. No document may be answered twice, nor one credential","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"answer two. Each holder key signs now, in the request’s order; a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" requiring user presence asks the holder once for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them all (","type":"text"},{"code":"KeychainKeyStore.Options.holderUserPresence","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"). On a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"WalletError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — the prompt cancelled, say — nothing was sent and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the request stands: try again, or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"decline"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/ProximityPresentation\/respond(answers:)","title":"respond(answers:)","role":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/KeychainKeyStore/Options-swift.struct/init(secureEnclave:persistent:holderUserPresence:tagPrefix:holderAccessGroup:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/keychainkeystore\/options-swift.struct\/init(secureenclave:persistent:holderuserpresence:tagprefix:holderaccessgroup:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"init","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"